THIRD-PARTY DATA NOTICE

The MIT license above covers the SOURCE CODE in this repository only.

Redistributed scientific data (microscopy images under `demo/`, images embedded
in `index.html`, and derived feature tables under `images/out/` and `web/`)
originate from public datasets released by the Broad Institute and the
JUMP-Cell Painting Consortium. Those upstream projects dual-license their
material: source code under BSD 3-Clause, and **data, results and figures under
